    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37704" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">prae-lŏco</span></b> , āvi,
			ātum, 1, v. a., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to set</i> or <i>place
				before</i>, <i>to put first</i> or <i>foremost</i> (postclass.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">si pro trochaeo paenultimo spondeum
					praelocaveris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart. Cap. 5, § 522</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Aug. Gen. ad Lit. 7, 17</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">consonans,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ter. Syll. p. 2390</span></i>
			.</div>
